{
  "id": "semantic_tokens/options/02_kind_names",
  "topic": "semantic_tokens",
  "subtopic": "options",
  "title": "Kind names",
  "summary": "`kinds` renames the token kinds the server announces",
  "prose": "Two kinds given one name merge into it, and a kind renamed to `\"\"` is not\nsent, leaving the editor's own color. The names are announced once, when the\neditor connects: a change takes a restart.",
  "status": "supported",
